e set of foes that will be the  main antagonists of the game the court  of owls a secret criminal society that  rules gotham from the shadows complete  with its own army of assassins called  the talons the court davaos is always  watching and listening and pulling the  strings from behind the scenes they  kidnap young kids and brainwash them  into becoming their assassins and have a  twisted way of dealing with their  enemies it's safe to say prepare  yourself for some mind-altering  hallucinations  and maybe a labyrinth the court of owls  are certainly a force to be reckoned  with and if you want to learn more about  them first of all check out scott snyder  and greg capullo's 2011 run in the  comics or take a look at this video our  very own tam made theorizing how they  could fit more into gotham knights i'll  link it in the description below fun  fact if you're wondering where the owl  part of the court comes from it's  because they're the natural predator of  the bat  each member of the team has their own  unique play style and abilities as well  as their own skill trees robin for  example can teleport by the justice  league satellite system and focuses more  on stealth nightwing has his acrobatics  red hood is proficient in many combat  techniques and batgirl will probably be  most familiar to those who have played  the arkham games having a similar  arsenal to batman as well as the tech  chops gotham knights can either be  played solo or with a friend via drop-in  dropout online co-op brawling will be  similar to the arkham games but the  combat system has been entirely  redesigned to work better in co-op so  you and a friend can do cool takedown  moves together  enemies will scale to your level so you  won't be prevented from going anywhere  or tackling something for fear of being  under leveled from the alpha gameplay  preview from 2020 where the gang tackles  mr freeze it was revealed that in these  villain encounters as they're called the  bosses will have different abilities  depending on the level you approach them  at if you decide to main one member of  the bat family you don't need to worry  about the others lagging behind as all  four share story progression and level  up even when you're not playing as them  it also looks like you can pick up items  from the bodies of foes but it's not  quite clear if there's crafting in the  game just yet but given that you have to  improve your equipment there might very  well be during the day the team will  regroup at the belfry working to find  clues improve equipment and prepare for  the night while you may not have the bat  cave and its tech treasures to help you  do have access to the bat computer which  according to wb montreal is an  incredibly important part of the game  when you're ready to venture out into  gotham to fight some crime the game will  fast forward you tonight gotham city has  five boroughs and they'll be bustling  with activity from villains like mr  freeze trying to manipulate the weather  to more run-of-the-mill crimes that the  bat family will need to tackle but at  the heart of the game will be the huge  mystery that you'll need to untangle the  court of owls gotham knights is being  made by wb games montreal who you might  recognize as the developers of batman  arkham origins from 2013. they also  worked on some of the dlc for arkham  knight in 2015. key death talent working  on the game includes its creative  director patrick redding who worked on  splinter cell blacklist and far cry 2  and its narrative director anne lemay  who worked on mass effect 3 and dragon  age inquisition originally set for 2021  gotham knights was delayed to some point  in 2022 it's set for release on  playstation 4 playstation 5 xbox one  xbox series s and x as well as pc  there you have it everything we know so  far about gotham knight for more on the  game as well as all the latest on  suicide squad kill the justice league  make sure to like this video and  subscri